              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "My Hot Southern Mess"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This review is for the cake as written, not the alterations to make it a vanilla cake and make a 2 cake bunny cake. I made the cake using gluten free flour, this is my only substitution. As written this makes a dense cake, which may seem gummy to some. When comparing this recipe to my go to \"Crazy Cake\" recipe it is only differs in the amount of baking soda and salt. The baking soda really needs to be a full teaspoon. I usually only use 1/2 teaspoon of salt as well. I did decorate my cake with an Easter theme to make it an Easter cake.",
